;pylm
; Font styles:
;    0: TDecorate(count=1170, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    1: TDecorate(count=15, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=10, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=のぞ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=おきて, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1320, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1199, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―That day came suddenly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I simply knelt, my hands on the tatami.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unable to lift my head, I could do nothing but regret.<PG>
The reason we had gathered at the meeting hall that day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was for the funeral of <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE> and Mother.<PG>
Only the day before, <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE> and I had discussed 'why Mother permits Droga.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And right after that, Mother and <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE> had thrown themselves from the cliff at the graveyard clearing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be that they took their own lives because I had raised such a subject?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I had not spoken of it, would this not have happened?<PG>
In truth, while I was researching Droga and the Green-Eye Curse-Killing, some part of me had thought of it as someone else's affair.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had not yet lived through any tragedy connected with Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At most, I had heard of the residents' disappearances that happened before I came here, and the story of a child with green eyes being killed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So somehow it had never felt real.<PG>
Seeing the two of them dead before my eyes like this, I became aware of how terrible a thing I had involved myself in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was not only the danger to myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Might I not end up putting even the people close to me in danger as well―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Such thoughts would not let my hands leave the tatami.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was powerless.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>, are you all right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The child born to <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE> and me called out to me like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm all right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I forced a smile at the child, who was <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="のぞ">peering</STYLE> into my face.<PG>
If I involved myself any further, might the danger not reach even this child?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I was truly meant to do was uncover the truth of Droga and the curse-killing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yet if, for that very reason, I put those around me in danger too, it would defeat the whole purpose.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\ミイラ能面.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Beside the remains of <STYLE ID="1">Ko-san</STYLE> and Mother lay one more body, wearing a Noh mask.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the mummy called Lady Verde.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The mummy of a girl named Tomi, who is said to have taken her own life about 300 years ago.<PG>
Lady Verde is enshrined in this meeting hall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The goddess that we, the people of Arata, worship.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seems this mummy, too, is an idol with a dark history of one kind or another, but...<PG>
But perhaps that, too, ends here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I looked any further into the secrets hidden in this settlement...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―A few days later, I took over as the Grand Witch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The residents did not know that I had been researching Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I was just one of the brides who had come from elsewhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had only to behave as one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Would doing just that not keep me, and everyone, safe?<PG>
I had lost all will.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now I would seek nothing more, doubt nothing―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If only everyone here now could go on living in peace as before―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I could do was seek nothing more.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And so, just as I was, I grew older year upon year.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The residents used Droga, and whenever a child with green eyes was born, they killed it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I followed <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="おきて">the law</STYLE> and did nothing but turn a blind eye.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My child grew up well, and new Western culture gradually found its way into the settlement too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the same time I, too, grew old and frail, fated to die just as I was.<PG>
―It was at just such a time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, I was 65 then.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A certain visitor came to this settlement.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------